  "details": "When I'm on the social menu, my friends might show up on blue or green, and I get eager to join them. Until I click on them, it immediately changes statuses to orange or red, and they are actually unavailable.\n\nThis could be due to an API desync, or a lack of refreshing. This is occurring on multiple versions including 1355 and 1357. Confirmed this bug happening to another friend on Live, while I was on beta.\n\nUnsure how to repro this bug, except to be online for a bit, and have friends change statuses.",
